\`\`\`

| Status | Meaning |
| :--- | :--- |
| \`complete\` | The stage's work is finished, artifact written. |
| \`blocked\` | An obstacle you cannot resolve in this turn. |

## Stage: again (role: worker)

## Upstream artifacts

- make: \`<ROOT>/.migent/sessions/s1/executions/e1/artifacts/make.md\`
- make verify report: \`<ROOT>/.migent/sessions/s1/executions/e1/artifacts/verify.md\`

## Execution

- Task: \`<SESSION>/task.md\`
- Session dir: \`<SESSION>\` (shared session files)
- Artifacts: \`<ART>\`

## Do

Read the task, then carry out the stage.
