exports[`protocol 3 prompt kinds under native resume, history replay and resume_from 1`] = `
{
  "first turn (resume_from) / native": "# Migent workflow stage

## Response contract

Write one JSON document to the handoff file (see Execution) before you finish. Migent reads only that file for the stage result. The response body is a free-form report for humans.

\`\`\`json
{"schema_version":1,"status":"complete","summary":"One-line report."}
{"schema_version":1,"status":"blocked","blocker":"What stops you."}
\`\`\`

Each line above is a separate example; write exactly one document. \`status\` is complete | blocked.

| Status | Meaning |
| :--- | :--- |
| \`complete\` | The stage's work is finished, artifact written. \`summary\` is optional. |
| \`blocked\` | An obstacle you cannot resolve in this turn. \`blocker\` is required. |

## Stage: again (role: worker)

## Upstream artifacts

- make: \`<ROOT>/.migent/sessions/s1/executions/e1/artifacts/make.md\`
- make verify report: \`<ROOT>/.migent/sessions/s1/executions/e1/artifacts/verify.md\`

## Execution

- Task: \`<SESSION>/task.md\`
- Session dir: \`<SESSION>\` (shared session files)
- Handoff file: \`<HANDOFF>\`
- Artifacts: \`<ART>\`

## Do

Read the task, then carry out the stage.
Write the artifact as \`again.md\` in the artifacts directory.",
